@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}

participant "C# or F#\nprovider" as Host #DBEAFE
participant "HostedResource\n(IDisposable)" as Owner #DCFCE7
participant "ProviderContext\nGCHandle + atomic retains" as Context #FEF3C7
participant "immutable native\nvtable" as VTable #F3E8FF
participant "Rust/C/C++\nconsumer" as Consumer #FFE4E6

Host -> Owner: HostProviders.Create…(provider, options)
Owner -> Context: allocate provider-scoped context
Context -> VTable: allocate and populate callbacks
Context --> Owner: owned retain + two-word resource

Consumer -> VTable: query_interface(interface ID, version)
VTable -> Context: type-erased dispatch
Context --> Consumer: capability vtable

Consumer -> VTable: retain(context)
VTable -> Context: atomic increment
Consumer -> VTable: operation(context, inputs, outputs)
VTable -> Context: validate, invoke provider, contain exceptions
Context -> Host: typed managed call
Host --> Context: immutable result
Context --> Consumer: status + owned output

Owner -> VTable: Dispose() / F# use scope
VTable -> Context: atomic decrement
Consumer -> VTable: release(context)
VTable -> Context: final atomic decrement
Context -> VTable: free context-owned tables
Context -> Context: free GCHandle

note over Context,VTable #E0F2FE
No global provider registry.
No monitor, mutex, or sequential callback gate.
end note
@enduml
